        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WELCOME TO POLAR STAR, WHERE THE MUSIC OF LOUD GUNSHOTS NEVER STOPS.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625390/extras/1b70216bbbf76a80e3581f0811398493.poster.avif?t=1760195351\" width=608 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625390/extras/1b70216bbbf76a80e3581f0811398493.webm?t=1760195351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625390/extras/1b70216bbbf76a80e3581f0811398493.mp4?t=1760195351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast your way to the top in a deadly tournament of turn-based duels, break the game rules by unlocking various items that turn the power balance upside-down. Calculate all possible outcomes and carefully plan your moves, or just give into the rush and relentlessly gamble with your life on the line.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SHOOT, DRINK, DEFEND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625390/extras/f217ad08e88deaddb930d4701c53a86f.poster.avif?t=1760195351\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625390/extras/f217ad08e88deaddb930d4701c53a86f.webm?t=1760195351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625390/extras/f217ad08e88deaddb930d4701c53a86f.mp4?t=1760195351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outsmart and overpower your opponents in a series of turn-based duels, master the three great actions in the wild game of intelligence, skill, trickery and luck. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A TRICK UP YOUR SLEEVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625390/extras/8b964995898887cc8bf44c123559fa20.poster.avif?t=1760195351\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625390/extras/8b964995898887cc8bf44c123559fa20.webm?t=1760195351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625390/extras/8b964995898887cc8bf44c123559fa20.mp4?t=1760195351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bend the rules of the game to your will with various items that you unlock throughout the game. Be thoughtful of what and when you use - it can cost you your life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MAKE IT TO THE TOP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625390/extras/9f0108ab7168ba4421d09b91f2d6a05e.poster.avif?t=1760195351\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625390/extras/9f0108ab7168ba4421d09b91f2d6a05e.webm?t=1760195351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625390/extras/9f0108ab7168ba4421d09b91f2d6a05e.mp4?t=1760195351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience 30-60 minute Story campaign and become №1 in this god forsaken, ice-cold bar in the middle of nowhere, where even the night sky stars can't shine through the endless blizzard.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AND THE NIGHT GOES ON</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625390/extras/e256b4b921626395617de15517babfd1.poster.avif?t=1760195351\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625390/extras/e256b4b921626395617de15517babfd1.webm?t=1760195351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625390/extras/e256b4b921626395617de15517babfd1.mp4?t=1760195351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continue your way to the top in an endless ARCADE mode where you can choose what items to play with.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WELCOME TO POLAR STAR, WHERE THE MUSIC OF LOUD GUNSHOTS NEVER STOPS.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625390/extras/1b70216bbbf76a80e3581f0811398493.poster.avif?t=1760195351\" width=608 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625390/extras/1b70216bbbf76a80e3581f0811398493.webm?t=1760195351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625390/extras/1b70216bbbf76a80e3581f0811398493.mp4?t=1760195351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast your way to the top in a deadly tournament of turn-based duels, break the game rules by unlocking various items that turn the power balance upside-down. Calculate all possible outcomes and carefully plan your moves, or just give into the rush and relentlessly gamble with your life on the line.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SHOOT, DRINK, DEFEND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625390/extras/f217ad08e88deaddb930d4701c53a86f.poster.avif?t=1760195351\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625390/extras/f217ad08e88deaddb930d4701c53a86f.webm?t=1760195351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625390/extras/f217ad08e88deaddb930d4701c53a86f.mp4?t=1760195351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outsmart and overpower your opponents in a series of turn-based duels, master the three great actions in the wild game of intelligence, ski